{"synopsis":"Sudah bertahuntahun sejak aku membuat tanganku penuh darah untuk kesatuan kerajaan United Empire dan kaisarnya Emperor Ragnar Aku ingin kembali ke kampung halamanku dan hidup dengan tenang untuk menebus dosadosaku Akan tetapi Kau adalah penyihir kelas 8 hebat yang mampu menggulingkan aku dan kerajaan pada saat yang sama Bagaimana mungkin aku akan membiarkan sebuah monster sepertimu tetap hidup Setelah dikhianati di ambang kematian oleh Ragnar yang juga merupakan temanku sekaligus kaisarku aku menusuk jantungku dengan belati yang sudah diimbuhkan sihir Penebusan yang kuinginkan adalah untuk meletakkan semuanya kembali ke tempat seharusnya","alternative_title":"8클래스 마법사의 회귀","author":"Ryu Song (류송)","artist":"Tess (테스)","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"5ea3271d-3d0d-4f78-9310-d92766b31284","number":"81","chapter":"81","title":"Chapter 81","date":"2024-11-28","released":"2024-11-28","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"20ae0852-8a41-4504-a3cf-3e461c45f7ce","number":"80","chapter":"80","title":"Chapter 80","date":"2024-11-28","released":"2024-11-28","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"33fc1245-4b72-4251-9d5c-8b33f40eb4d3","number":"79","chapter":"79","title":"Chapter 79","date":"2024-11-28","released":"2024-11-28","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"13adb80e-7f55-46e0-96e3-d1f763aabe75","number":"78","chapter":"78","title":"Chapter 78","date":"2024-11-25","released":"2024-11-25","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"656c45ca-8617-4e88-be0e-572d2f3a70eb","number":"77","chapter":"77","title":"Chapter 77","date":"2024-11-28","released":"2024-11-28","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"696505bb-bf8c-4906-a22d-2a431bcae0f7","number":"76","chapter":"76","title":"Chapter 76","date":"2024-11-28","released":"2024-11-28","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"d03dbf1d-c0ab-4e5f-86fc-d85539b3a0e2","number":"75","chapter":"75","title":"Chapter 75","date":"2024-11-28","released":"2024-11-28","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"d5807260-7e41-4725-9137-87bc2ff2bfe4","number":"74","chapter":"74","title":"Chapter 74","date":"2024-11-25","rel